+<p xml:id="W0002-00-0465-pa-06bf"><pb n="446" facs="facs:W0002-0465" xml:id="W0002-00-0465-pb-05b5"/><lb xml:id="W0002-00-0465-lb-0001"/><hi rendition="#initCaps">S</hi>I se <milestone unit="article" rendition="#dagger" n="20" xml:id="W0002-00-0465-mi-0916"/> jacto, y alabo a si, o a los suyos, o a qualquier otro contra la
